iv>         </ol>         <ol id=\"5ffd16ebdfa5472897633cbd1933e898\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"新闻标题\" data-zh=\"新闻标题\">            新闻标题           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\">           2013届毕业          </div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"发布时间\" data-zh=\"发布时间\">            发布时间           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\">           2014-11-30          </div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content editor_Hidden editor_contentHidden\" id=\"a3e6503833d24dd8b6070f173287934c\">            <p></p>            <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/file/showImg.do?newName=DSCN9414.JPG&amp;relativePath=/sites/default/files/guyf/&amp;descDir=\"></p>            <p></p>           </div>          </div>         </ol>         <ol id=\"7e5162742846402ea4f33d43d2294407\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"新闻标题\" data-zh=\"新闻标题\">            新闻标题           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\">           2015届毕业生          </div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"发布时间\" data-zh=\"发布时间\">            发布时间           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\">           2015-07-18          </div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content editor_Hidden editor_contentHidden\" id=\"9669bf06ba2c4e3f9dea7fc126e380bb\">            <p></p>            <p>@校训石下</p>            <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/file/showImg.do?newName=IMG_1404_0.JPG&amp;relativePath=/sites/default/files/guyf/&amp;descDir=\"></p>            <p> </p>            <p>@图书馆前</p>            <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/file/showImg.do?newName=IMG_1412_0.JPG&amp;relativePath=/sites/default/files/guyf/&amp;descDir=\"></p>            <p> </p>            <p>@步行街上</p>            <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/file/showImg.do?newName=IMG_1422_0.JPG&amp;relativePath=/sites/default/files/guyf/&amp;descDir=\"></p>            <p> </p>            <p>@肯德基里</p>            <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/file/showImg.do?newName=IMG_1425_1.JPG&amp;relativePath=/sites/default/files/guyf/&amp;descDir=\"></p>            <p>@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@</p>            <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/file/showImg.do?newName=IMG_1369_0.JPG&amp;relativePath=/sites/default/files/guyf/&amp;descDir=\"> <img alt=\"\" src=\"/file/showImg.do?newName=IMG_1368_0.JPG&amp;relativePath=/sites/default/files/guyf/&amp;descDir=\"></p>            <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/file/showImg.do?newName=IMG_1403_0.JPG&amp;relativePath=/sites/default/files/guyf/&amp;descDir=\"> <img alt=\"\" src=\"/file/showImg.do?newName=IMG_1361_0.JPG&amp;relativePath=/sites/default/files/guyf/&amp;descDir=\"></p>            <p></p>           </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"a7530e3f97acca3e949ed204e4466b2epart\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(116, 110, 111);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">项目简介</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"2f108d5678e237a04ce72eedce13ac3f\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"420d2e90aa57628953e1ee6aafbf5ef9\">           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><strong>项目名称：</strong>多模高光谱遥感图像处理</p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><strong>项目来源：</strong>国家自然科学基金重点国际合作研究项目</p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><strong>起止时间：</strong>2018.01.01-2022.12.31</p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><strong>项目经费：</strong>271.60万元</p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><strong>结题摘要：</strong><span style=\"text-indent:2em;\">项目主要开展“多模高光谱遥感图像处理”理论与方法研究，以多模高光谱遥感在海岸带监测应用为背景，面向多时相高光谱、高光谱视频、高光谱激光雷达一体化三种探测成像模式，探索多模高光谱数据时间-空间-光谱多维度信息处理的新理论和新方法，旨在解决不同模式下高光谱遥感图像中同类地物光谱不确定性、多时相高光谱遥感模式下光谱漂移与失配、高光谱视频模式下目标光谱动态性、高光谱激光雷达模式下多维度特征异构性及多模高光谱遥感应用中的关键科学问题。</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent: 2em; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"text-indent:2em;\">项目研究在多模高光谱遥感图像表示、多时相高光谱图像地物分类、高光谱视频目标跟踪、立体高光谱数据地物分类、无人机多光谱-激光雷达一体化探测系统研制和多模高光谱遥感海岸带监测应用等方面取得了理论/方法突破和重要进展：(1)构建了图-谱超像素、多时相、视频、高光谱-激光雷达联合的多模本征分解模型，从成像探测机理出发，提高同类光谱反射率一致性，形成多模高光谱图像本征分解理论；(2)构造了多时相高光谱数据时-空-谱对齐模型，提取时相不变空-谱多特征，解决多时相高光谱数据光谱漂移和失配问题；(3)提出了高光谱视频张量表示方法，形成图-谱-时相多维度信息的四阶张量表示，实现目标图-谱时变动态特性提取，提升目标跟踪精度；(4)构造了多/高光谱点云数据一体化特征判别张量表达模型，保留点云数据的局部结构和判别信息，提出了多属性平滑图卷积网络，实现遥感场景的三维地物分类并提升解译精度；(5)设计了多光谱-激光雷达数据采集的同步系统结构，规范化光谱图像与激光雷达点云数据的多传感器多波段联合立体配准技术流程，实现多光谱点云生成、可视化及解译。</span></p>           <p style=\"text-indent: 2em; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"text-indent:2em;\">项目成果包括：(1)发表本领域重要国际期刊论文30篇；(2)在本领域权威期刊《中国科学: 技术科学》英文版组织多模高光谱图像处理专刊1次；(3)授权发明专利8项；(4)撰写多模高光谱中文专著1部，申报国家科学技术学术著作出版基金；合作撰写出版英文专著1部；(5)培养国家杰青1名，中国科协青年人才托举工程入选者1名，IEEE会士1名，顶级国际期刊主编1名，招收/培养博士后4人，博士毕业生6人，硕士毕业生11人；(6)研制了无人机多光谱-激光雷达一体化探测系统；(7)项目中方团队于2019年申请获批黑龙江省重点实验室，项目负责人担任实验室主任；(8)成果应用于两个国家级滨海湿地自然保护区生态监测及天宫二号任务数据处理。</span></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(116, 110, 111);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3102\"></i><em id=\"3102\" data-more=\"0\">项目成员</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"dcbe9694f6ee5780f6dbe866c9894179\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"2b7c4c2c15cadda50214f3123efc92e5\">           <p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5em; text-indent: 0em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">项目负责人：谷延锋</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5em; text-indent: 0em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">中方主要成员：刘天竹、高国明、王青旺、金旭东、王腾飞、孙超、杨京礼、刘欢、王煜坤、谭苏灵</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5em; text-indent: 0em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">境外合作人员：法国Jocelyn Chanussot教授（IEEE Fellow）、澳大利亚Xiuping Jia教授（IEEE Fellow，IEEE Transaction on Geoscience and Remote Sensing主编）<br></span></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(116, 110, 111);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">项目成果总体情况</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"17ab0988bbbb6af678c93ed02debd43a\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"21f697c7098bbf47ac9a0c3285410301\">           <p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0em; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none;\">(1)</span>学术论文：发表本领域重要国际期刊论文30篇，其中23篇发表在遥感领域顶级期刊IEEE地球科学与遥感汇刊Trans.GRS，6篇发表在《中国科学》系列英文版；</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0em; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">(2)组织专刊：在本领域权威国际期刊《Science China: Technological Sciences》组织多模高光谱遥感图像处理专刊1次；</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0em; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">(3)发明专利：授权发明专利8项，受理发明专利3项；</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0em; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">(4)学术专著：撰写多模高光谱中文专著1部《多模高光谱成像本征分解》，获国家科学技术学术著作出版基金资助；合作撰写出版英文专著1部《Hyperspectral Image Analysis: Advances in Machine Learning and Signal Processing》；</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0em; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">(5)人才培养：杰青1人（项目负责人），中国科协青年人才托举工程入选者1名（中方主要参研人员），IEEE会士1名（澳方课题组长），遥感领域顶级国际期刊IEEE Trans.GRS主编1名（澳方课题组长），招收/培养博士后4人，博士毕业生6人（其中1人获中国图象图形学会优秀博士学位论文提名奖，2人获哈尔滨工业大学优秀博士学位论文），硕士毕业生11人；</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0em; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">(6)系统设计：研制了无人机多光谱-激光雷达一体化探测系统；</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0em; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">(7)平台建设：项目中方团队于2019年申请获批黑龙江省天空地一体化智能遥感技术重点实验室，项目负责人担任实验室主任，多模高光谱遥感图像处理被列为该实验室核心方向之一；</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0em; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">(8)成果应用：应用于黄河三角洲和山口红树林两个国家级自然保护区生态监测，以及空间目标飞行器天宫二号任务数据处理。</span></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(116, 110, 111);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">学术论著</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"4f9fe9aad118adcf72ab22bb9c8b5be8\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"0e62165a6f65de1ec9521c6e9885dc1f\">           <p><strong>期刊论文</strong><br></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230216/1676520493341046292.jpg\" title=\"1676520493341046292.jpg\"></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230216/1676520493372076073.jpg\" title=\"1676520493372076073.jpg\"></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230216/1676520493372013488.jpg\" title=\"1676520493372013488.jpg\"></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230216/1676520493419073770.jpg\" title=\"1676520493419073770.jpg\"></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230216/1676520493450043250.jpg\" title=\"1676520493450043250.jpg\"></p>           <p><strong><br></strong></p>           <p><strong>代表性博士学位论文</strong></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230216/1676521555398082700.jpg\" title=\"1676521555398082700.jpg\" alt=\"6.jpg\"></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>    <div id=\"40fb3b455561829c8b8264797a79422cpart\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(116, 110, 111);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Personal Information</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"d04c847b495a537b17821b09266e2fa0\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"90ab982c6dd6e5ff118df24db5e4e608\">           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑;\">Research direction: Aerospace intelligent information processing, hyperspectral remote sensing, multi-dimensional information detection and processing systems.<br><br>Honorary titles: National Outstanding Youth, Selected National High level Talents, Leading Young and Middle aged Science and Technology Innovation Talents of the Ministry of Science and Technology.<br><br>Academic positions: Vice Dean of the School of Electronic and Information Engineering at Harbin Institute of Technology, Professor and Doctoral Supervisor, Director of the China Association for Remote Sensing Applications, Director of the Key Laboratory of Sky Earth Integrated Intelligent Remote Sensing Technology in Heilongjiang Province, Associate Editor of IEEE Journal of Earth Science and Remote Sensing, Editorial Board Member of \"Chinese Science: Technical Science\", Editorial Board Member of \"Chinese Journal of Image and Graphics\", etc.<br><br>Project awards: Hosted key international cooperation projects of the National Natural Science Foundation of China, major scientific instrument development projects, national key projects of ministries and commissions, and has won provincial and ministerial level scientific and technological awards multiple times.</span></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>    <div id=\"f31e0eaa9d21d8bc7228f4cc1223078cpart\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(116, 110, 111);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3101\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"3101\">研究领域</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"6ad519d9408094e376caf5b96b15e234\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"42ccd3b3d8bb9910b9647c663ae9f706\">           <p>Major Research</p>           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">            <li><p>Aerospace information processing</p></li>            <li><p>Multimodal Remote Sensing Foundation Model</p></li>            <li><p>VHR Remote Sensing Image Interpretation</p></li>            <li><p>Multimodal Hyperspectral Remote Sensing Detection &amp; Processing</p></li>           </ul>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>   </div>   </div> </body></html>"